Z||000016||Max The Chainsaw||05-20-2001||11:05 PM||||My GT I bought from Monkeyman has the taillight assy's painted the same color as the car. I think they just gave them one thin coat. It looks neat and the lights shine right thru, but I worry about haw well others can see them. I'm gonna replace them with another set as soon as it comes back from the paint shop. <P>To clean the plastic I've found that good old fashioned car wax does a very good job restoring plastic.<BR>||||reg||1
