Z||000018||skitime||05-21-2001||08:23 AM||||I not sure the question posed by Tina has been interpreted correctly.  If it has then may I ask this question.  My rear lenses and many others that I have seen on the GTs have faded black sections around the PONTIAC lettering.  The clear sections are fine no scratches so it is not the outside of the lense that is the problem.  It is that one lense is blacker than the other lense around the PONTIAC lettering.  Has anyone found a solution to repairing this?||||reg||1
